# 行尾规范
# 脚本类文件必须在所有平台检出为 LF：否则 Linux 上 postinstall.sh / start.sh
# 会因 \r 报 "bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M"。批处理与 PowerShell 保持 CRLF。
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.tpl text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# 发行产物不入库，显式标记二进制以防万一
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.deb binary
*.rpm binary
*.png binary
